source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A nested marker of another unordered type closes the nested list and opens a second one under the same item; jiro writes both nested, separated by the blank line that is all JFM has to hold two lists apart.
-- input.jira --
* a
** b
-- c
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>a
	<ul>
		<li>b</li>
	</ul>
	<ul class="alternate" type="square">
		<li>c</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- a
    - b

    - c
-- warnings.json --
[]
